OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with woman's murder
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man charged with murdering a woman at
OL,7,Fa former church in Dartmouth has
OL,8,Fappeared in court.
OL,10,FLuke Rigby, 38, is accused of murdering
OL,11,F46-year-old Rebecca Grass at the
OL,12,Fconverted St Barnabas Church in
OL,13,FNewcomen Road on 6 October.
OL,15,FHe also faces charges of causing
OL,16,Fgrievous bodily harm with intent,
OL,17,Fassault and assaulting an emergency
OL,18,Fworker.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,346,340,200,160,0,100
