OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with woman's murder
OL,4,Aappears in court
OL,5,
OL,6,FRigby appeared by video link from
OL,7,FTorquay police station at Plymouth
OL,8,FMagistrates' Court and and is due to
OL,9,Fappear at Plymouth Crown Court on
OL,10,FMonday. During the hearing he spoke
OL,11,Fonly to confirm his name, age and
OL,12,Faddress and that he understood the
OL,13,Fproceedings.
